# Trained model artifacts — binaries, reproducible from seed + data.
# The model_versions table is the source of truth for what was trained.
# Deliberate exception (Phase 14): the one currently-shipped artifact is
# committed, since Render's free tier has no persistent disk and this file
# can't be regenerated at boot without breaking the pinned "shipped model
# id/threshold must never change" invariant from the pre-deployment pass.
backend/models/*
!backend/models/isolation_forest_behavioural_only_381419f9.joblib

# RAG corpus data — the local Chroma vector store and the cached MITRE
# ATT&CK STIX bundle. Both binary/large and fully regenerable from
# source docs + scripts/ingest_rag_corpus.py; never commit either.
backend/data/

